{"key":"kadane-ea4b834b5a5a656e","sourceHash":"ea4b834b5a5a656eafbe25dcd816504ec24683867362979c2f9c5bac09d0851b","pattern":"kadane","category":"dynamic-1d","title":"Kadane Maximum Subarray: Mental Model","idea":"At each item choose whether to extend the current segment or start a new one.","complexity":"O(n) time · O(1) space","source":"fn maximum_subarray(values: &[i32]) -> i32 {\n    assert!(!values.is_empty());\n    let (mut ending, mut best) = (values[0], values[0]);\n    for &x in &values[1..] {\n        ending = x.max(ending + x);\n        best = best.max(ending);\n    }\n    best\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let result = maximum_subarray(&[-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4]).to_string();\n    println!(\"{result}\");\n}\n","sites":[{"line":2,"function":"maximum_subarray","statement":"assert!(!values.is_empty());"},{"line":3,"function":"maximum_subarray","statement":"let (mut ending, mut best) = (values[0], values[0]);"},{"line":4,"function":"maximum_subarray","statement":"for &x in &values[1..] {"},{"line":5,"function":"maximum_subarray","statement":"ending = x.max(ending + x);"},{"line":6,"function":"maximum_subarray","statement":"best = best.max(ending);"},{"line":7,"function":"maximum_subarray","statement":"}"},{"line":8,"function":"maximum_subarray","statement":"best"},{"line":12,"function":"main","statement":"let result = maximum_subarray(&[-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4]).to_string();"},{"line":13,"function":"main","statement":"println!(\"{result}\");"},{"line":14,"function":"main","statement":"}"}],"version":1,"input":"[-2,1,-3,4,-1,2,1,-5,4]","stdout":"6\n","values":[{"type":"&[i32]","data":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"-2"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"-3"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"4"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"-1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"-5"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"4"}],"tuple":false}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"-2"}},{"type":"i32","data":